      ],
      "challenge": "Make a single frame carry an entire story — an empire, a duel, an odyssey — at a size where every flaw shows.",
      "idea": "Direct it like a film shot: write a scene bible, block the composition first, then generate and source every element separately so light, scale and depth stay under control.",
      "system": "Elements are generated one by one and matched with stock, cut out, relit with rim light toward a single sun, and composited and graded in a Python + Photoshop pipeline that renders at any resolution.",
